n excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 卡杜格利","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%9D%9C%E6%A0%BC%E5%88%A9"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94714835"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1011819"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148263","name":"巴巴努萨","country":"SDN","lat":11.33335,"lon":27.8,"kind":"city","region":"SD-KS","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159133927","name":"達馬津","country":"SDN","lat":11.7704,"lon":34.34999,"kind":"city","region":"SD-NB","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"達馬津 · 地点概要","geo":"苏丹国家铁路网其中一条支线的终点站即位于达马津，但其列车服务已在多年前停止使用。\n达马津为热带半干旱气候，柯本气候分类法的代码为BSh。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q311307","articleTitle":"達馬津","sourceRevision":94713079,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 达马津","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%81%94%E9%A6%AC%E6%B4%A5"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94713079"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q311307"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159133933","name":"海亚站","country":"SDN","lat":18.33623,"lon":36.38418,"kind":"city","region":"SD-RS","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134973","name":"马纳基尔","country":"SDN","lat":14.25038,"lon":32.97999,"kind":"city","region":"SD-GZ","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134979","name":"沉迪","country":"SDN","lat":16.68049,"lon":33.42002,"kind":"city","region":"SD-NR","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134983","name":"柏柏尔","country":"SDN","lat":18.01703,"lon":33.98329,"kind":"city","region":"SD-NR","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134987","name":"凯马","country":"SDN","lat":19.6337,"lon":30.41658,"kind":"city","region":"SD-NO","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"凯马 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"克尔玛，又译作科尔玛，至少5500年前古代努比亚人的首都，位于今苏丹共和国北部。\n赖斯纳曾认为克尔玛是古埃及人的卫星城，将其与下游的埃及一起纳入尼罗河沿岸古代史中。","culture":"遗址南沿的墓葬中有四个大墓的直径超过，被认为是克尔玛晚期国王的陵墓，在这些陵墓中发掘出土一些带有荷鲁斯等埃及神灵的图案和艺术品。\n在克尔玛遗址墓葬中，通常可以发现埃及文化的影响，尤其是在陶器和随葬品上。","see":"作为首都和王室墓地，克尔玛遗址揭示了克尔玛王朝复杂的社会结构。\n克尔玛是其所在地区最早发掘的遗址，赖斯纳的工作被视为该地区考古学的奠基。\n克尔玛的早期考古始于美国人乔治·安德鲁·赖斯纳进行的埃及和苏丹调查，赖斯纳受哈佛大学和波士顿美术博物馆联合委任进行考古调查。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1107569","articleTitle":"克尔玛","sourceRevision":92888066,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 克尔玛","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E5%B0%94%E7%8E%9B"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92888066"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1107569"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159135019","name":"艾德蒂姆","country":"SDN","lat":13.9904,"lon":32.29998,"kind":"city","region":"SD-NW","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159135023","name":"乌姆鲁瓦巴","country":"SDN","lat":12.91044,"lon":31.2,"kind":"city","region":"SD-KN","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159135743","name":"恩纳胡德","country":"SDN","lat":12.69043,"lon":28.42001,"kind":"city","region":"SD-KN","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159135747","name":"穆格莱德","country":"SDN","lat":11.03373,"lon":27.73334,"kind":"city","region":"SD-KS","rank":7,"capital":0}]}